{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-composition-affine}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d4bb5644ea52415f8569674f2a1823a0947b290d0a6452b008e462c7a4176823", "source_text": "This follows from the discussion in\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>\nand\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:437c474ca0079688e848237e3a125f61428e61e6fcc9aea14d7ee770a884cf26", "unit_id": "tag:0CHS:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[rr]_f \\ar[rd]_a & & \\mathcal{Y} \\ar[dl]^b \\\\\n& \\mathcal{Z}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$a$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Delta_b$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7437c63425d3414e5b1ef21a979775f9ad60f3e7cbe23ac793e2d994d5e4e874", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7916c38316080abdb18f79f77fd21b15af0e19cdbfbb25378b0746ee75bf7bfc", "source_text": "Let\n<MATH_0001>\nbe a commutative diagram of morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0002> is affine and <MATH_0003> is affine, then\n<MATH_0004> is affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6b844a6f9fec0a7e42a3c44e8543ddda36c091d374d716afe60c0743c1955b4a", "unit_id": "tag:0GQE:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\text{pr}_2 : \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$a$", "MATH_0003": "$(1, f) : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Delta_b : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Y} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to\n\\mathcal{Y} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$f = \\text{pr}_2 \\circ (1, f)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-affine}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-section-2-fibre-products}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-affine}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-composition-affine}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0e3c33183fc2de8a03dafa8d2a6a8d0032b57b6befcd5ce32a65b0ae2bfa70fe", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2755e2471d578c1080802ca66f728cf47e2c40f43c2d410186a7f852183e905c", "source_text": "The base change\n<MATH_0001>\nof <MATH_0002> is affine by Lemma <REF_0001>. The morphism\n<MATH_0003>\nis the base change of\n<MATH_0004>\nby the morphism <MATH_0005> (see material in\nCategories, Section <REF_0002>).\nHence it is affine by\nLemma <REF_0003>.\nThe composition <MATH_0006> of affine morphisms is affine by\nLemma <REF_0004> and the proof is done.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f79b9fdf4884a26081257595161e5a97ef2f61281c4a5ecd79a808f21fc1fc9d", "unit_id": "tag:0GQE:proof"}
